  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TheIslamic Relief programme &quot;Cash-for-work for Unemplyed young        graduates&quot; is to provide temporary job opportunities (6 months)for    600 unemployed recent graduates in the Gaza Stripwith 360 family      dependent members. The beneficiaries will be given temporary work     placements at various local institutions such as; Private sector      companies, Local NGOs and Public institutions</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TheIslamic Relief programmet &quot;Cash-for-work f&#xf6;r arbetsl&#xf6;s unga        akademiker&quot; &#xe4;r att ge tillf&#xe4;lliga arbetstillf&#xe4;llen (6 m&#xe5;nader) f&#xf6;r    600 arbetsl&#xf6;sa nyutexaminerade i Gaza Stripwith 360 familjen &#xe4;r       beroende medlemmar. Mottagarna kommer att ges tillf&#xe4;lliga             praktikplatser vid olika lokala institutioner s&#xe5;som, privata f&#xf6;retag, lokala frivilligorganisationer och offentliga institutioner</narrative>
  </description>
